UpdateSharePrice_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── when caller is not the updater
│  └── it should revert with NotUpdater
├── when updater pushes the first price
│  ├── it should set latest and anchor to the same value
│  └── it should emit SharePriceUpdated
├── when updater pushes within the default max-change window
│  └── it should update latest price
├── when updater pushes above the per-asset max-change limit
│  └── it should revert with PriceChangeTooBig
├── when window seconds elapse and updater pushes again
│  └── it should rotate the anchor to the new price
└── when prices are pushed for two different vaults
   └── it should track them independently
